---

## Frontend start here

### 1) OAuth
Call:
- \`GET /api/v1/ticktick/auth?redirect_uri=...\`

Then TickTick redirects to:
- \`GET /api/v1/ticktick/callback?code=...&state=...\`

Your frontend should read the final redirected URL and extract:
- \`userId\`

### 2) Save content
Call:
- \`POST /api/v1/content\`

